            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Padrail 1.2</h3>
<ul>
  <li>The edges ignore you while you type, so brushing the trackpad with your palm no longer changes the volume. You can switch it off in Settings.</li>
  <li>After each update, a notification tells you what's new.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
