            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Padrail 1.0</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Slide the right edge of the trackpad for volume, the left edge for brightness, the bottom edge for keyboard light.</li>
  <li>The top edge adapts to the app in front: tabs, zoom, tracks or desktops.</li>
  <li>Opens at login and keeps itself up to date.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
